OL,3,GNEWSALabour's Lucy Powell faces
OL,4,Aquestions from BBC local radio stations
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour's deputy leader Lucy Powell will
OL,7,Fthis morning take part in a series of
OL,8,Fquick-fire interviews on BBC local
OL,9,Fradio stations - watch live above
OL,11,FHer party is preparing to host its
OL,12,Fautumn conference, which takes place in
OL,13,FLiverpool from Sunday
OL,15,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,16,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,17,Fyears. Leaders of the Conservatives,
OL,18,FGreens, Lib Dems and Reform UK are
OL,19,Fgetting a similar opportunity before
OL,20,Ftheir conferences
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
